Package: runix
Type: Package
Title: Common Core for the Runix System-Administration Framework
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-08-08
Authors@R: c(
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "troy@cornball.ai",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-4248-604X")),
    person("cornball.ai", role = "cph"))
Description: The zero-dependency common core shared by the Runix subsystem
    packages: the typed condition taxonomy and constructor, a retryability
    registry, the subsystem-neutral injectable-runner machinery (environment
    and error class supplied by the caller), and the neutral result object.
    Subsystem packages ('pkgstate', 'rsystemd', ...) import this; it never
    imports them and carries no external dependencies.
